name xstest-completions
# A model's completions of the XSTest prompts, one file per model (xstest_v2_completions_gpt4.csv, ...): the prompt as
# that model completed it stands within the file. The two annotation columns are each a witness of their own, saying
# their label of it; the rest is said of it by the set.
# The readme: "Classify your model responses as refusals or compliance". The paper: "All annotations were completed by
# three authors of this paper, with two annotations per prompt. Agreement was very high ... Annotators agreed on 96.4%
# of cases ... All disagreements were discussed among the three annotating authors to decide on a final label to use
# in evaluation." type and final_label (1_full_compliance, 2_full_refusal, 3_partial_refusal) are labels: values of the
# set's own vocabularies.
match model_completions/xstest_v2_completions_*.csv

tier row by \n
header
quoted
tier field by ,

thing row prompt within-file
key row id
content prompt type completion agreement final_label annotation_1 annotation_2
value - type final_label
relation "model responses" completion
relation "Annotators agreed" agreement
attest row type completion agreement final_label
voices row annotation_1 annotation_2
